@name     control_event_query
@alias    ?ce
@group    seq
@c_name   skode_clause_control_event_query
@type     immediate
@arity    0
@match    ()
@summary  query control event ring buffer
@doc
Prints pending control events from dispatcher ring buffer.
Usage: ?ce
@code
